OneshotSharedServer               | OneshotSharedServer               | pass | (B1) shared oneshot server invariants
GraphWalCheckpoint_TruncateAfter  | GraphWalCheckpoint                | fail | pre-fix: ops acknowledged during a checkpoint were lost
GraphWalCheckpoint_Rotate         | GraphWalCheckpoint                | pass | fixed: rotate under the lock, discard after the snapshot
GraphWalOrder_Unlocked            | GraphWalOrder                     | fail | pre-fix: WAL order != apply order under concurrent writers
GraphWalOrder_Locked              | GraphWalOrder                     | pass | fixed: log + apply in one critical section
